=== reading of the failure ===
dut.st=14 = O_RUN, n_total=0 (11'd1 << 11 wrapped), oidx=0, ecnt=0, busy=1.
FILL DID terminate: cnt+1 also wraps in 11 bits, so cnt+1==n_total fires at
cnt=2047 and the unit swallowed all 2048 elements.  The deadlock is in OUT:
issue = (oidx != n_total) = (0 != 0) = 0 forever, so no address is ever
presented, pv stays 0, m_valid never rises and ecnt+1==n_total never runs.
